            <ArticleTitle>Reflecting on events.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>16-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article is intended to give an insight into the world of pre-hospital clinical care. For nurses who are not involved with respiratory or emergency care, it also illustrates the importance of T pieces in treating patients with respiratory problems, and that familiarity and practice are crucial for success with these vital, albeit rarely needed, tools.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
